I board the next bus.
This is a BEST bus.
There are many people here.
I stand near the door.
The conductor comes near me.
I take a ticket.
Then I ask him.
"Sir, I am going to Marine Drive."
"Where do I get down?"
The conductor smiles.
He says, "You get down at the Gymkhana stop."
"From there, walk straight towards the sea."
I ask, "Left or right?"
He says, "No, do not turn left or right."
"Just walk straight towards the sea."
I say, "Thank you, sir."
After some time, the bus stops at the Gymkhana stop.
I get down there.
